    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d403-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0638" n="568" xml:id="pg568"/>

                <head>[Telegram.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New Orleans,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 26, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">H. McCulloch:</hi></p>
                <p>Wilderness at Southwest Pass. If desired, get her ready for Vera Cruz by morning;
                    only difficulty seems accommodations for so large a party. General Steedman just
                    in; has despatches for Mexico. Wishes to send the same by cutter, if going.
                    Please answer.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. P. KELLOGG, <hi rendition="#italic">Collector.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
